# Zul Ashur, Lich Lord: "{T}: You may cast target Zombie creature card from your graveyard this turn" (CR 601.3, 602.2). Bot1 casts
# Zul Ashur and a Walking Corpse (a 2/2 Zombie) on turn 1; on turn 2 Bot2 casts its own Walking Corpse and kills Bot1's with a Lightning
# Bolt. On turn 3 Bot1 kills Bot2's Walking Corpse with its own Bolt, so each graveyard holds one Walking Corpse. Targeting the
# opponent's is refused (it is not "your graveyard"), and it stays there. Targeting its own is accepted: the {T} is paid (Zul Ashur
# tapped), and the Corpse is cast from the graveyard for {1}{B} (the pool empty after, so the cost is paid exactly) and is on the battlefield.

